*.log

### Secrets / credentials (dev-only; never commit) ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Private keys are never committed. The dev *public* key (src/main/resources/dev/jwt-public.pem)
# is intentionally committed: it is not a secret and is required for the local dev JWT fallback.
jwt-private.pem
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore

